* feat(ux): Wave C — Cmd+K palette, file hover preview, tool search, coach marks

C.1 - Cmd+K command palette: adds mod+k as an alias for the existing
  command palette (mod+shift+p remains; both now work)

C.2 - Inline file hover preview: file names in the session review diff
  list now show a HoverCard with the first 20 lines of the file on
  hover, using the existing readFile prop wired through SessionReview

C.3 - Tool output search (Cmd+F): Cmd+F / Ctrl+F while a BasicTool
  block is focused opens an inline search bar; types highlight matches
  in the tool output via DOM text-node walking + mark elements;
  Esc closes and clears highlights

C.4 - Post-session onboarding coach marks: after a user's first
  completed assistant turn, a dismissible coach mark tooltip appears
  cycling through 3 tips (fork, @mention, model switch); each tip is
  individually dismissible and persisted in settings.onboarding

* fix(ui): wrap Collapsible in div to satisfy ref/onKeyDown/tabIndex types

CollapsibleProps doesn't include ref, onKeyDown, or tabIndex. Move these
onto a wrapper div so the DOM ref and keyboard handling still work.

